<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Jan-Nov trade swings to $332.6 mln deficit.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Jan-Nov trade swings to $332.6 mln deficit.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan posted a trade deficit of $332.6 million in the first 11 months of this year after a surplus of $29.0 million in the same 1995 period, the National Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>KYRGYZ MERCHANDISE TRADE  Jan-Nov 96  Jan-Oct 96  Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p> exports ($ million)		 464.2	422.1	  115.6</p>
<p> imports			   796.8	716.8	   86.6</p>
<p> trade balance		  -332.6     -294.7	  +29.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
